    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="class_module_imports_manager" kindref="compound">ModuleImportsManager</ref> that operates based on a workload definition (see -thinlto-workload-def). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For modules that do not define workload roots, it applies the base <ref refid="class_module_imports_manager" kindref="compound">ModuleImportsManager</ref> import policy. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
